00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:05,080
抱歉  是我新恋情的让我自信膨胀了
Sorry, that's the cockiness of my new relationship talking.

346
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,240
我们都该走了
We should all go.

347
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:11,100
反正我们谁都没有任何活下去的理由
None of us have anything left to live for anymore anyway.

348
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:13,560
不好意思  我可是有大把...
Uh, excuse me, I have plenty...

349
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:14,820
好吧  你说得对  走吧
okay, you're right, let's go.

350
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:26,040
太棒了  餐厅没事
Yes! Yes, it's okay.

351
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:30,000
我猜台风在点评网上查过咱们
I guess the hurricane looked us up on Yelp

352
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,060
然后觉得应该避而远之
and stayed the hell away.

353
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:34,280
在暴风雨中毫发无损
It survived the storm!

354
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:35,720
我的餐厅还活着
My diner's alive.

355
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:38,420
是啊  它的某些"鼠"性刚还在厨房追我呢
Yeah, parts of it have chased me around the kitchen.

356
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:41,220
我超爱你的搞笑
I love how you're funny.

357
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:46,240
暴风雨走了  我身体的感知是对的
The storm is gone. My body got it right.

358
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:49,200
现在如果它能自己供血就好了
Now, if it could only pump blood on its own.

359
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:53,300
不错嘛  奥列格也没死
Great. Oleg survived too.

360
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:54,820
这场台风逊爆了
This hurricane sucked.

361
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,820
我回了家
I made it home,

362
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,880
可苏菲和男保姆都走了
but Sophie and the Manny were gone.

363
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:02,580
我可以从栗宝的眼神
And I could tell by the look in Chestnut's eyes

364
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:03,980
和他的鬃毛上的红酒看出
and the wine on his mane

365
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:05,440
他们不会回来了
that they're not coming back.

366
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:11,840
奥列格  你在这里啊
Oh... Oleg, you're here!

367
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:17,020
苏菲
Sophie,

368
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:18,380
你来了
you're here.

369
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:21,280
我好担心你  发生什么事了
Oh, I was so worried. What happened?

370
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:22,620
我的西班牙油条吗
To my churro?

371
00:17:23,820 --> 00:17:25,100
是啊  都弄湿了
Well, yeah, it got wet.

372
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,260
奥列格
Oh, Oleg,

373
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:30,260
我不想刮台风的时候没有你在身边
I didn't want to be in the hurricane without you.

374
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:33,200
我也不想别人上你的时候
And I didn't want anyone to be in you

375
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,060
没有我在身边
without me.

376
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:38,220
别傻了  我们现在是一家人
Don't be silly. We're family now.

377
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:41,280
再说了  暴风雨让我欲火焚身
Plus, the storm got me all horned up.

378
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:42,680
我承认
Confession:

379
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,920
让我湿身的不只是暴风雨
I'm not just wet from the storm.

380
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,440
老天
Oh, my God,

381
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:50,780
这家伙是不是特会见缝插棒啊
does this guy always know what to say or what?

382
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:55,020
奥列格  我们回家吧
Oh, Oleg, let's go home.

383
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:56,840
我爱幸福结局
I love happy endings.

384
00:17:57,440 --> 00:18:00,140
如果芭芭拉睡着了
Oh, well, if Barbara's sleeping,

385
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:02,620
没准在回家的路上我就能让你"性福"一把哦
I might be able to give you one on the way home.

386
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,240
卡洛琳
Caroline,

387
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:10,900
我们得谈谈刚在里面发生的事
we need to talk about what happened in there.

388
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,820
好的  但我非得在场吗
Okay, but do I have to be here?

389
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:16,640
听着  我一直在想有时候
Look, I've been thinking that sometimes

390
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,440
极端天气会让你做一些疯狂的事
crazy weather makes you do crazy things.

391
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:21,460
对  我刚听苏菲和奥列格瞎扯了
Yeah, I just listened to Sophie and Oleg talk

392
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:22,280
大概一个小时吧
for like an hour.

393
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:26,820
我...我想说的是
I... I guess what I'm trying to say is

394
00:18:26,994 --> 00:18:27,196
我们结束了
we're dones-ville.

395
00:18:27,196 --> 00:18:27,830
阿憨
Han.

396
00:18:29,260 --> 00:18:34,600
不不不
No, no.

397
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:35,740
别开口求我
Don't beg.

398
00:18:35,900 --> 00:18:38,000
跟你分开已经够难了
This is hard enough as it is.

399
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:38,980
但是...
But...

400
00:18:38,980 --> 00:18:40,860
打起精神来
keep that chin up.

401
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:44,700
你会找到对的人
You'll find someone.

402
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:46,460
我建议你上网找
I recommend the Internet.

403
00:18:47,620 --> 00:18:48,188
多谢  阿憨
Thanks, Han.

404
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:50,500
其实还挺有意思  虽然压根就没开始过
It was fun while it never started.

405
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:56,040
麦克斯  我不喜欢看到你这样
Max, I hate seeing you like this.

406
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:59,540
或许兰迪屏蔽你的唯一原因是...
You know what? Maybe Randy only blocked you because...

407
00:18:59,540 --> 00:19:01,540
因为他不想毁掉给我的惊喜
Because he didn't want to ruin the surprise of him

408
00:19:01,540 --> 00:19:02,560
他要来这里见我了
coming here to see me?

409
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:06,540
好吧  当然是啊
All right. Yep. Sure.

410
00:19:06,820 --> 00:19:08,620
我再去看看他的快拍
I'm gonna check his Snapchat again.

411
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,860
等会吧  麦克斯  先去抱抱我们的甜品吧
Not now, Max. Let's go hug our dessert bar.

412
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:12,380
它一定吓坏了
It was probably so scared.

413
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,940
我在跑因为我迟到了
Hey! I'm running 'cause I'm late.

414
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:17,340
我得去纽约...
Gotta get to New York...

415
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,580
这下好  他没讲完就断了
Great, his story cut off.

416
00:19:20,620 --> 00:19:21,360
但你说对了
But you were right!

417
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:22,500
深表怀疑
I was?

418
00:19:22,521 --> 00:19:26,240
画面动了
Ooh, it unfroze.

419
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,120
交响乐团在好莱坞露天剧场的演出
Philharmonic at the Hollywood Bowl.

420
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:32,500
就这样吧
Well, that's it.

421
00:19:32,660 --> 00:19:34,100
他不会来纽约了
He's not coming to New York.

422
00:19:34,460 --> 00:19:35,900
我得面对现实
I have to face reality.

423
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:39,140
他约了好朋友菲尔在洛杉矶打保龄球
He's bowling in LA with his buddy Phil.

424
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:45,960
我的上帝
Oh, my God!

425
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:47,380
很扯  对吧
Cray, right?

426
00:19:47,460 --> 00:19:49,460
我都不知道兰迪喜欢打保龄球
I didn't even know Randy liked bowling.

427
00:19:50,780 --> 00:19:52,300
不  麦克斯  你看
No, Max, look!

428
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:56,900
那树是新种的吗  还是一直在那里的
Is that tree new or has it always been there?

429
00:19:57,460 --> 00:19:59,600
我知道树上的保险套肯定不是
I know the condom stuck to it hasn't.

430
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:05,040
那个破餐厅居然没事  而我们美丽的甜品酒吧
The diner is fine, but our beautiful dessert bar

431
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:06,600
却被台风袭击了
gets hit by the hurricane?

432
00:20:07,420 --> 00:20:08,040
可是...
But...

433
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,980
你的头发现在看起来挺好啦
your hair looks good right now.

434
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,100
才"挺好"吗
Just "Good"?

435
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:15,049
我要打给阿憨
I'm calling Han.

436
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,820
我现在竟然觉得我需要他
I weirdly feel like I need him now.

437
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:20,760
直接转去语音信箱了
It's going straight to voicemail.

438
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:24,560
阿憨  我刚打给你呢
Han! I was just trying to call you.

439
00:20:24,900 --> 00:20:26,920
没错  我屏蔽你了
Yeah, I blocked you.

440
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:30,260
我现在真的不想再谈那事
I just can't go there right now.

441
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,040
卡洛琳  别哭
Caroline, don't cry.

442
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:37,280
我们有保险的不是吗
We have insurance. Right?

443
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:39,400
你说的话我百分百都没听啦
I don't listen to 100% of what you say.

444
00:20:39,940 --> 00:20:41,000
我们会没事的
We'll be fine.

445
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:44,840
我只是觉得屏蔽别人这事太伤人了
I just think blocking a person is mean.
